amily: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZqrKNOK6ctgrqbUur2qW1ico97pPiaPjt5x7icibrGXiakav7PpjmKMoangBZoQIWfauIWgmyqJ9F4Hw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n           关于 Sol Naciente\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n          Café Sol Naciente\n         </span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n          位于哥斯达黎加的塔拉珠产区，多塔区域下的圣塔玛丽亚小镇，\n         </span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          诞生于2015年，由拥有超过30年种植经验的 Arturo Bonilla 先生和他的伴侣 Xinia Martínez 女士共同创立。Xinia 一直陪伴 Arturo 参与每一个过程。如今，在他们的子女的协助下，这个家庭项目得以蓬勃发展。他们克服了重重挑战，成功将他们的咖啡推向了国际市场，并成为 NAMA CAFÉ 计划和“Esencial Costa Rica”项目的一部分。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TAItLvVFX72lS9CMMpYViahUWn17Wv6th3RHIMwleXnRfpz5ABsOARiaZkbBWDPZ4pBOeEdYlLiajyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-decoration: none;\">\n          NAMA CAFÉ 是一项旨在减少咖啡生产过程中碳排放的倡议，而“Esencial Costa Rica”则是一个推广哥斯达黎加优质产品和服务的国家品牌。通过参与这些项目，Café Sol Naciente 不仅展示了其对高品质咖啡的承诺，也体现了其对可持续发展和环境保护的坚定支持。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S9XRhXhQMII7rELicTM5TUxiaehbBMHFDTmVmeTqjMzzsaEg8BqibEFC7KLgguagPONx3X3M2VkO1Ew/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-decoration: none;\">\n          这个家庭企业的成功不仅源于他们对咖啡的热爱和专业知识，还得益于他们对每一个细节的关注和对卓越品质的不懈追求。Café Sol Naciente 的故事是一个关于坚持、合作和对咖啡热情的生动例证，他们的咖啡如今已成为国际市场上的一颗璀璨明珠。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S9XRhXhQMII7rELicTM5TUxeFZohRRclSeCicZ1kMTdwuciaqPt5fgVaicWib3YAz9ds2IOXfBUfZVmOg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TAItLvVFX72lS9CMMpYViaha0tuJicytw3N7MY8GVeGicfeb617B1ricdj0PHq8sD4sIW3kmlKJOQrPQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          在超过28年的时间里，Arturo 和 Xinia 一直致力于以可持续的方式经营我们的咖啡庄园。他们见证了这片土地的成长，就像那些守护着我们收成的雄伟桉树一样。这些桉树不仅是庄园的标志，也象征着他们对环境保护和可持续发展的承诺；\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n          2018 CoE #16\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
